{
  "_comment": [
    "Every tile in the generated world. Design owns this file.",
    "id doubles as the column in assets/tiles/tiles.png, so id 6 is the 7th tile",
    "in the sheet. Ids 1 to 5 are the archived placeholder zones and are not",
    "used by the world generator. Id 0 is air and never draws.",
    "hardness: how long it takes to break, relative. 0 means it cannot be mined.",
    "opacity: how much light this tile blocks, 0 to 255.",
    "emit:    how much light this tile gives off, 0 to 255.",
    "wall:    true means it only ever draws to the background layer.",
    "drop: what breaking this tile gives you. Empty means nothing.",
    "light_colour: [r,g,b] of the glow this tile casts, if it emits at all.",
    "platform: stand on it from above, walk up through it from below."
